commit 8b0bf1289ac88a7d537fcd718f7b200aca8a5c30
Author: Mingjian Liu <mingjianliu@macbookpro.lan>
Date:   Tue May 12 14:02:44 2026 -0700

    fix(B26-B30): ghost threat, spatial constraints, utility waste, perf, CDR
    
    B26: analyzeHealerExposureAtBurst — skip enemies beyond 40-yard CC range
      and skip enemies who are in CC at burst time (can't cast CC while CC'd)
    
    B27: buildDeathOutcomeSummary — skip missed-external flags when teammate
      was >40 yards from dying player or LoS-blocked at death time
    
    B28: buildOffensiveWasteSummary — include ccSpellIds in the high-value
      filter for immunity windows so CC/utility spells (HoJ, Silence,
      Mindgames) are tracked when cast into immunities
    
    B29: isLockedOut O(N) -> O(log N) — pre-build lockout intervals once per
      (unit, spellId) pair; use binary search per death query
    
    B30: isAvailableAt CDR awareness — check resetSpellIds (e.g. Cold Snap
      for Ice Block) to detect cooldown resets between last cast and death
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

