    fix(B17): emit [DEATH] for Holy Priest Spirit of Redemption deaths
    
    When a Holy Priest dies into Spirit of Redemption, the parser records the death
    in consciousDeathRecords (UNIT_DIED with unconsciousKill=1) rather than deathRecords.
    The prompt was missing the [DEATH] signal, making these matches unanalyzable.
    
    Now includes SoR deaths in friendlyDeaths with note annotation so Claude knows
    the healer is casting as a ghost after death.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

