         longer fire when a teammate is CC'd nearby. ~23% reduction in false
         positives.
    B39: Suppress empty delta [RES] lines — no-op deltas with no CD changes
         are now omitted entirely.
    
    Verified: 20-match fresh corpus, zero regressions, all fixes confirmed.

